>
  <p>
    Bangladesh Travel Guide is free to read and may use affiliate links or advertisements in future. This page explains how our affiliate relationship may affect the website in future, so you can decide how to use the links on our site when you come back later. The affiliate links will be applied to different pages of <a href="https://www.bangladeshtravelguide.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.bangladeshtravelguide.com</a>.
